# Shree Astro admin panel — environment
#
# Vite inlines these at build time, so they are readable by anyone who loads
# the panel: this is deployment configuration, never a secret. Copy to `.env`
# for local work, or set them in the host's build settings.

# Where the API lives. Left unset the panel falls back to
# http://localhost:5000/api/v1, which is only right on a dev machine — a
# deployed build must set this to the real API, over https, or every page
# fails to load.
VITE_API_URL=https://shree-astro-backend.vercel.app/api/v1
